 "description": "Read the linked user's active Hunts, stored requested criteria and recorded historical alerts. Use before editing an existing Hunt to preserve unmentioned terms and select its returned watch_id. Stored requested sizes/budgets and alert clocks do not prove current price, stock, fit or delivery. Returns a bounded list; has_more=true means additional Hunts are omitted. Use when the user asks what Remode is watching or whether anything changed.",
